exemplar.en:
Corrected code patch, inside useSaveNote:
```ts
const attemptRef = useRef(0);

const handleSave = async () => {
  const text = content.trim();
  if (text === '') {
    attemptRef.current += 1;
    setState({ status: 'empty' });
    return;
  }
  const attempt = attemptRef.current + 1;
  attemptRef.current = attempt;
  setState({ status: 'saving' });
  try {
    await save(text);
    if (attempt !== attemptRef.current) return;
    setState({ status: 'saved' });
  } catch (error) {
    if (attempt !== attemptRef.current) return;
    setState({ status: 'error', message: String(error) });
  }
};
```
Why it fixes the defect. Two acceptance rules were unmet. The saving transition was missing, so t1, t3, t5 and t6 kept the previous state instead of saving. The attempt guard was missing, so at t7 stale attempt C resolved and overwrote attempt D's saving state with saved, breaking the rule that the latest attempt owns the state. Five of the nine traced events list saving as the expected state, and only the guarded version reaches all five. The guard also suppresses stale rejections.

Proposed tests. One, save with non-blank content and assert saving immediately. Two, save with blank content and assert empty with no save call. Three, reject then retry and assert saving clears the error. Four, resolve and assert saved. Five, reject and assert error with the message. Six, start attempt C, start attempt D, settle C before D, and assert the state stays saving after C, with only D setting the final state.

Limitations. Only the supplied fictional code, contract and trace were reviewed and nothing was executed, so no real network or rendering behaviour is claimed. The contract is silent on what happens to an in-flight attempt when the empty branch runs, so incrementing the counter there is my interpretation and needs reviewer confirmation.

exemplar.zh:
修正程式碼，於 useSaveNote 內：
```ts
const attemptRef = useRef(0);

const handleSave = async () => {
  const text = content.trim();
  if (text === '') {
    attemptRef.current += 1;
    setState({ status: 'empty' });
    return;
  }
  const attempt = attemptRef.current + 1;
  attemptRef.current = attempt;
  setState({ status: 'saving' });
  try {
    await save(text);
    if (attempt !== attemptRef.current) return;
    setState({ status: 'saved' });
  } catch (error) {
    if (attempt !== attemptRef.current) return;
    setState({ status: 'error', message: String(error) });
  }
};
```
為何能修正問題。接納文件有兩項規則未被滿足。缺少儲存中轉換，因此 t1、t3、t5 及 t6 維持先前狀態而非顯示 saving。缺少嘗試守衛，因此在 t7，過時嘗試 C 解決後以 saved 覆寫嘗試 D 的 saving 狀態，違反最新嘗試擁有狀態的規則。九個追蹤事件中有五個列出預期狀態為 saving，只有加入守衛的版本能達到全部五個。該守衛亦抑制過時嘗試的拒絕結果。

建議測試。一，以非空內容儲存並立即斷言 saving。二，以空白內容儲存並斷言 empty 且不呼叫儲存。三，拒絕後重試並斷言 saving 清除錯誤。四，解決並斷言 saved。五，拒絕並斷言 error 附帶訊息。六，開始嘗試 C，開始嘗試 D，讓 C 在 D 之前完成，斷言 C 完成後狀態維持 saving，只有 D 決定最終狀態。

限制。僅審查提供的虛構程式碼、合約及追蹤記錄，並未執行任何程式碼，因此不聲稱真實網絡或渲染行為。合約未說明空白分支執行時進行中嘗試應如何處理，因此在該處遞增計數屬我的詮釋，需審查者確認。

