exemplar.en:
Decision: replace the defective route and client. The route must read expectedVersion, call applyBasketUpdate once, map updated to 200 { basketId, version, items } and version_conflict to 409 { code: 'version_conflict', currentVersion }. Do not use getVersion then updateItems because that read-then-write is not atomic and loses concurrent updates, as shown in defective-client-route. The client must keep the caller-owned expectedVersion for one attempt and on 409 follow the contract: read currentVersion, refresh with GET, then re-submit the user's intended items with the returned currentVersion at most once.
Corrected route:
```ts
app.patch('/api/baskets/:basketId', async (req, res) => {
  const { basketId } = req.params
  const { expectedVersion, items } = req.body
  const result = await applyBasketUpdate({ basketId, expectedVersion, items })
  if (result.outcome === 'updated') {
    return res.status(200).json({ basketId, version: result.version, items })
  }
  return res.status(409).json({ code: 'version_conflict', currentVersion: result.currentVersion })
})
```
Corrected client:
```ts
export async function saveBasket(basketId: string, expectedVersion: number, items: Array<{ sku: string, qty: number }>) {
  const first = await fetch(`/api/baskets/${basketId}`, {
    method: 'PATCH',
    headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' },
    body: JSON.stringify({ expectedVersion, items })
  })
  if (first.status === 200) return await first.json()
  if (first.status !== 409) throw new Error('basket_update_failed')
  const conflict = await first.json()
  await fetch(`/api/baskets/${basketId}`, { method: 'GET' })
  const second = await fetch(`/api/baskets/${basketId}`, {
    method: 'PATCH',
    headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' },
    body: JSON.stringify({ expectedVersion: conflict.currentVersion, items })
  })
  if (second.status !== 200) throw new Error('basket_update_failed')
  return await second.json()
}
```
Tests: two concurrent PATCH with expectedVersion 3 should produce one 200 and one 409, reserve stock once and increment version by one. For the number case, SKU-C starts at 18, one success reserves 5, the 409 reserves zero, leaving 13. Force a 409 and assert the client uses conflict.currentVersion. Limitations: this simulation does not prove production database isolation or merchant traffic. Escalate to Ada Wong before release.

exemplar.zh:
決策：取代有缺陷的路由及客戶端。路由必須讀取 expectedVersion，呼叫 applyBasketUpdate 一次，把 updated 對應 200 { basketId, version, items }，把 version_conflict 對應 409 { code: 'version_conflict', currentVersion }。不要使用 getVersion 然後 updateItems，因為該讀取後寫入並非原子，會遺失並行更新，如 defective-client-route 所示。客戶端必須在首次嘗試保留呼叫方擁有的 expectedVersion，並在 409 時依合約：讀取 currentVersion，以 GET 重新整理，然後以回傳的 currentVersion 重新送出使用者原定項目，最多一次。
修正後路由：
```ts
app.patch('/api/baskets/:basketId', async (req, res) => {
  const { basketId } = req.params
  const { expectedVersion, items } = req.body
  const result = await applyBasketUpdate({ basketId, expectedVersion, items })
  if (result.outcome === 'updated') {
    return res.status(200).json({ basketId, version: result.version, items })
  }
  return res.status(409).json({ code: 'version_conflict', currentVersion: result.currentVersion })
})
```
修正後客戶端：
```ts
export async function saveBasket(basketId: string, expectedVersion: number, items: Array<{ sku: string, qty: number }>) {
  const first = await fetch(`/api/baskets/${basketId}`, {
    method: 'PATCH',
    headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' },
    body: JSON.stringify({ expectedVersion, items })
  })
  if (first.status === 200) return await first.json()
  if (first.status !== 409) throw new Error('basket_update_failed')
  const conflict = await first.json()
  await fetch(`/api/baskets/${basketId}`, { method: 'GET' })
  const second = await fetch(`/api/baskets/${basketId}`, {
    method: 'PATCH',
    headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' },
    body: JSON.stringify({ expectedVersion: conflict.currentVersion, items })
  })
  if (second.status !== 200) throw new Error('basket_update_failed')
  return await second.json()
}
```
測試：兩個並行 PATCH 帶 expectedVersion 3 應產生一個 200 及一個 409，只預留庫存一次，版本增加一。數字個案中，SKU-C 初始為 18，一次成功預留 5，409 預留零，剩餘 13。強制一次 409，並斷言客戶端使用 conflict.currentVersion。限制：此模擬不能證明實際生產資料庫隔離或商戶流量。發佈前須轉交 Ada Wong。

