Fictional incident data. Baseline monthly oversold orders: 3,600. A sampled week showed 62 confirmed oversell incidents traced to non-atomic stock reservation across channels. Candidate estimates: I1 atomic stock reservation, high evidence, cost HKD 96,000, reduction 1,440 oversold orders per month. I2 low-stock alert automation, medium evidence, cost HKD 58,000, reduction 1,080. I3 multi-location stock sync dashboard, low evidence, cost HKD 185,000, reduction 2,160. Current reservation contract: decrement available quantity atomically and reject when quantity exceeds available.
```js
function reserveStock(available, quantity) {
  if (quantity > available) return { ok: false, available };
  // defect: read-modify-write not atomic, concurrent calls can oversell
  return { ok: true, available: available - quantity };
}
```

