Fictional contract. A cart qualifies at or above the tier minimum. The engine must award the highest qualifying tier only. The discount equals subtotal times percent divided by 100, rounded down to whole HKD, capped at maxDiscountHKD. Coupon codes and shipping are out of scope. The helper below is supplied for review only and is never executed.
```js
// FICTIONAL illustrative helper, review only, never executed
const TIERS = [
  { id: "t1", minSubtotalHKD: 500,  percent: 5,  maxDiscountHKD: 60 },
  { id: "t2", minSubtotalHKD: 1200, percent: 8,  maxDiscountHKD: 150 },
  { id: "t3", minSubtotalHKD: 2500, percent: 12, maxDiscountHKD: 400 }
];

function tierDiscountHKD(subtotalHKD) {
  const tier = TIERS.find(t => subtotalHKD > t.minSubtotalHKD);
  if (!tier) return 0;
  const raw = Math.floor(subtotalHKD * tier.percent / 100);
  return Math.min(raw, tier.maxDiscountHKD);
}
```

