Handover for REP-2048. Decision: severity SEV2, priority P1. Evidence: defect log reports 20 scripted runs and 6 mismatches, so affected share is 6 / 20 * 100 = 30%, above the 5% P1 threshold. The mismatch is intermittent because runs 3, 8 and 17 show local draft v42 'Draft Approved' while server saved v41 'Draft'. Code excerpt shows onBack navigates without flushing the 500 ms debounce. Workaround exists because local draft can be restored within 10 minutes, so this is not SEV1. Fix: replace `function onBack() {
