}` with `async function onBack() {
  await flushPendingSave()
  navigate('/notes')
}` and keep a promise for the pending save. Proposed tests: fake-timer unit test for rapid type then Back, 20-run end-to-end test with Back delays from 0 to 800 ms, assert server body equals latest draft and stale baseVersion is rejected. Risk: only 20 runs in one browser. Owner: QA verifies fix, engineer patches autosave. Next: attach log excerpt and add regression test to CI.

