Decision: patch the handler to use one-based paging and validate page. Current code starts at page * pageSize, so page=1 returns doc-051 to doc-100. The contract requires page=1 to return doc-001 to doc-050.

Patch:
```ts
if (!Number.isInteger(page) || page < 1) {
  return { error: "invalid_paging" }
}
